 "accueil.meta.property-og-description.blockchain-souveraine-ia-d-o": "Sovereign blockchain, orchestration AI, borderless FinTech and training, around the fixed-supply native coin BOSA.",
 "accueil.meta.property-og-title.coinbosa-un-ecosysteme-globa": "Coinbosa — a unified global ecosystem",
 "accueil.p.chaque-brique-en-detailce-que-fait-chaque": "<strong>Every building block, in detail</strong>What each product does, where it stands, and what is still missing before it can join the chain.",
 "accueil.p.coinbosa-academy-enseigne-en-ligne-et-en-s": "CoinBosa Academy teaches online and in regional seminars: FinTech,\n          blockchain, artificial intelligence and trading.",
 "accueil.p.coinbosa-chain-est-une-blockchain-evm-souv": "Coinbosa Chain is a sovereign EVM blockchain, deployed to production\n          on August 7, 2026, designed for industrial scale and critical\n          financial applications.",
 "accueil.p.coinbosa-chain-relie-les-produits-de-l-eco": "Coinbosa Chain connects the products of the ecosystem: payments, artificial\n        intelligence, neobank, training and privacy. The BOSA coin is their common\n        unit, with a fixed supply sealed in block 0.",
 "accueil.p.coinbosa-deploie-progressivement-une-infra": "CoinBosa is progressively deploying a neobank infrastructure, in\n          strict compliance with local and international financial regulations,\n          know your customer and anti-money laundering included. It allows\n          direct conversion between cryptocurrencies and fiat currencies, as\n          well as automated bank deposits and withdrawals.",
 "accueil.p.coinbosa-omni-ia-studio-est-un-orchestrate": "CoinBosa Omni AI Studio is an orchestrator: it resolves the complexity\n        of model selection instead of leaving it to the user.",
 "accueil.p.coinbosa-omni-ia-studio-evalue-les-modeles": "CoinBosa Omni AI Studio evaluates the models available for each\n          request, keeps the one that fits and distributes the work to\n          specialized agents.",
 "accueil.p.coinbosa-repond-a-la-fragmentation-entre-l": "Coinbosa addresses the fragmentation between decentralized finance,\n        everyday cryptocurrency use and access to advanced artificial\n        intelligence technologies. These four domains are not juxtaposed:\n        they share the same chain and the same native coin.",
 "accueil.p.coinbosa-reunit-une-infrastructure-blockch": "Coinbosa brings together a sovereign blockchain infrastructure, an\n      orchestration artificial intelligence, FinTech solutions with no\n      geographic restriction and training. The native BOSA coin, with a sealed\n      fixed supply of 700,000,000 units, is its currency.",
 "accueil.p.deux-briques-repondent-au-meme-probleme-le": "Two building blocks address the same problem: the passage between\n        cryptocurrencies and everyday money.",
 "accueil.p.l-offre-totale-de-bosa-est-fixee-a-700-000": "The total supply of BOSA is fixed at 700,000,000 units, split across\n        thirteen allocations. No further issuance will ever take place.",
 "accueil.p.la-chaine-integre-une-suite-defi-et-dex-na": "The chain embeds a native DeFi and DEX suite: issuing smart contracts,\n        creating liquidity pools, deploying BRC20 tokens. The products of the\n        ecosystem rest on it.",
 "accueil.p.la-coinbosa-card-ouvre-les-paiements-du-qu": "The Coinbosa Card opens everyday payments worldwide; the neobank\n          platform provides direct conversion between cryptocurrencies and fiat\n          currencies.",
 "accueil.p.la-tokenomique-completeles-treize-postes-d": "<strong>The full tokenomics</strong>The thirteen allocations, line by line, with the network settings.",
 "accueil.p.le-consensus-parlia-vise-un-bloc-toutes-le": "The Parlia consensus targets one block every 5 seconds. On a test\n        bench measured over 500 consecutive blocks, the average duration comes\n        to 5.018 seconds.",
 "accueil.p.le-depot-le-livre-blanc-et-l-explorateur-s": "The repository, the whitepaper and the explorer are open. The community is on\n        Telegram, and technical questions are raised on the repository.",
 "accueil.p.le-modele-d-ia-proprietaire-coinbosa-entra": "The proprietary CoinBosa AI model, trained on financial and software\n          engineering data.",
 "accueil.p.le-studio-genere-ensuite-le-workflow-corre": "The studio then generates the corresponding workflow and distributes\n          the instructions to the specialized agents: code, image, text, video.",
 "accueil.p.pensee-des-2022-elle-repond-au-probleme-de": "Designed as early as 2022, it addresses the problem of cryptocurrency\n          holders who can neither pay for their everyday purchases nor obtain\n          cash immediately while traveling abroad. Unlike competing cards\n          restricted to Europe or the United States, the Coinbosa Card is\n          deployed worldwide, with no regional restriction.",
 "accueil.p.pour-chaque-requete-le-moteur-calcule-un-s": "For each request, the engine computes a suitability score per model:\n          domain relevance, latency, accuracy. The model with the best score is\n          selected.",
 "accueil.p.support-multi-modele-universel-generation": "Universal multi-model support: code generation, image creation,\n          content writing, analysis.",
 "accueil.p.un-ecosysteme-technologique-education-marc": "A technology ecosystem — education, markets, payments, banking, privacy — with a sovereign blockchain as its foundation.",
 "accueil.span.aucun-membre-de-l-equipe-ne-vous-demandera": "<b>No member of the team will ever ask you for your recovery phrase or your private key.</b> Any such request is\n        an attempt at theft, whatever the account sending it may look like.",
 "accueil.span.ces-valeurs-ne-sont-pas-des-intentions-ell": "<b>These values are not intentions.</b> They are fixed in block 0 and\n      can be read back on the public RPC endpoint, without having to take our\n      word for it.",
