 "chaine.h1.le-reseau-son-coin-natif-et-la-tokenomique": "The network, its native coin, <span class=\"grad\">and the tokenomics that seals it</span>.",
 "chaine.h2.defi-dex-et-smart-contracts": "DeFi, DEX and smart contracts.",
 "chaine.h2.les-parametres-tels-qu-ils-sont-inscrits": "The settings, exactly as recorded.",
