 "chaine.h3.sept-cents-millions-et-rien-de-plus": "Seven hundred million, and nothing more",
 "chaine.meta.name-description.coinbosa-chain-chain-id-2626": "Coinbosa Chain: chain ID 26262, Parlia consensus, 5 s blocks measured at 5.018 s over 500 blocks, BOSA native coin, fixed supply of 700,000,000, BRC20.",
 "chaine.meta.name-twitter-description.chain-id-26262-consensus-par": "Chain ID 26262, Parlia consensus, 5-second blocks, fixed supply of 700,000,000 BOSA, BRC20 standard. The network settings and its official tokenomics.",
 "chaine.meta.name-twitter-title.chaine-bosa-le-reseau-coinbo": "Chain &amp; BOSA — the Coinbosa network and its native coin",
 "chaine.meta.property-og-description.chain-id-26262-consensus-par": "Chain ID 26262, Parlia consensus, 5-second blocks, fixed supply of 700,000,000 BOSA, BRC20 standard. The network settings and its official tokenomics.",
 "chaine.meta.property-og-title.chaine-bosa-le-reseau-coinbo": "Chain &amp; BOSA — the Coinbosa network and its native coin",
 "chaine.p.bosa-se-divise-en-18-decimales-le-format-d": "BOSA is divided into 18 decimals, the unit format of Ethereum virtual\n            machines. Wallets and development tools apply it without any particular\n            setting.",
 "chaine.p.ces-valeurs-sont-figees-dans-le-bloc-de-ge": "These values are fixed in the genesis block, or applied by the client to each\n          block produced. Two nodes that do not display the same block 0 hash are not\n          on the same chain.",
 "chaine.p.coinbosa-chain-est-une-blockchain-evm-souv": "Coinbosa Chain is a sovereign EVM blockchain, deployed to production on\n        August 7, 2026 and designed for industrial scale and critical financial\n        applications. Its settings are recorded in the genesis block and can be read\n        back from the public endpoint.",
 "chaine.p.deux-requetes-suffisent-l-identite-de-la-c": "Two requests are enough: the identity of the chain, then the genesis block from\n          which everything else follows.",
 "chaine.p.l-offre-finale-est-scellee-au-bloc-de-gene": "The final supply is sealed in the genesis block. It depends on no later\n            decision: what exists today is what will exist.",
 "chaine.p.l-offre-totale-du-coin-bosa-est-strictemen": "The total supply of the BOSA coin is strictly fixed at 700,000,000 BOSA. No\n          further issuance will ever take place.",
 "chaine.p.la-cible-est-de-5-secondes-par-bloc-la-moy": "The target is 5 seconds per block. The average recorded on the 500-block\n            test bench is 5.018 seconds: the gap to the target lies within the\n            variance of sealing.",
 "chaine.p.la-coinbosa-chain-integre-une-suite-defi-e": "The Coinbosa Chain embeds a native DeFi and DEX suite, open to\n          developers.",
 "chaine.p.la-manipulation-est-la-meme-dans-tout-port": "The procedure is the same in any EVM wallet. A mistyped identifier sends funds to a network\n          that is not yours: prefer adding it from code.",
 "chaine.p.la-repartition-officielle-de-l-offre-de-bo": "The official breakdown of the BOSA supply, as it appears in the whitepaper.\n          The volumes add up exactly to the supply sealed in the genesis block.",
 "chaine.p.la-suite-native-permet-de-creer-des-pools": "The native suite makes it possible to create liquidity pools on the chain.",
 "chaine.p.le-contrat-systeme-du-consensus-est-ecrit": "The consensus system contract is custom-written, in Solidity and\n            Go-Ethereum, and runs directly on-chain.",
 "chaine.p.le-standard-de-jeton-natif-de-la-chaine-es": "The native token standard of the chain is BRC20, ERC-20 compatible in its\n            interface, covered by a complete automated test suite in continuous\n            integration.",
 "chaine.p.les-developpeurs-emettent-des-smart-contra": "Developers issue smart contracts and deploy BRC20 tokens without\n            restriction.",
 "chaine.p.les-intervalles-de-validateurs-sont-fixes": "Validator intervals are fixed per epoch of 200 blocks. The rollover is\n            verified at blocks 200, 400, 600 and 800: that is where the engine\n            re-reads the full validator set.",
 "chaine.p.se-connecter-deployer-verifierl-ajout-par": "<strong>Connect, deploy, verify</strong>Adding from code, the methods the public endpoint\n        accepts, and the interface of the BRC20 standard.",
 "chaine.p.sur-un-banc-de-test-mesure-sur-500-blocs-c": "On a test bench measured over 500 consecutive blocks in continuous\n          integration, the average block time settles with minimal variance.",
 "chaine.span.applications": "Applications",
 "chaine.span.chaine-bosa": "Chain &amp; BOSA",
 "chaine.span.copier": "Copy",
 "chaine.span.copier-2": "Copy",
 "chaine.span.duree-moyenne-de-bloc-banc-de-500-blocs": "Average block time — 500-block test bench",
 "chaine.span.fiche-du-reseau": "Network fact sheet",
 "chaine.span.identite-de-la-chaine-et-bloc-0": "Chain identity and block 0",
 "chaine.span.l-identifiant-de-chaine-fait-partie-de-la": "<b>The chain identifier is part of the signature.</b> EIP-155 replay\n        protection binds every signed transaction to network 26262: a transaction\n        issued here is valid only on this chain. The genesis block hash and its state\n        root can be read back on the official explorer.",
 "chaine.span.le-bloc-de-genese-est-la-reference-son-emp": "<b>The genesis block is the reference.</b> Its hash and its state root\n        commit the initial state of the chain: a node that returns other values is not\n        serving Coinbosa Chain, whatever name it bears.",
 "chaine.span.le-coin-natif": "The native coin",
 "chaine.span.le-consensus": "The consensus",
 "chaine.span.se-connecter": "Connect",
 "chaine.span.tokenomique-officielle": "Official tokenomics",
 "chaine.span.un-identifiant-mal-recopie-envoie-des-fond": "<b>A mistyped identifier sends funds to a network that is not\n        yours.</b> The network name, Coinbosa Chain, and the address of\n        <a href=\"https://explorer.coinbosa.com\" rel=\"noopener\">the explorer</a> complete\n        the fact sheet; the shortest check remains comparing the genesis block\n        hash.",
 "chaine.span.une-tokenomique-stricte-se-lit-a-ses-totau": "<b>A strict tokenomics is read in its totals.</b> The thirteen allocations\n        make up 100% of the supply, that is 700,000,000 BOSA, and the supply is sealed at\n        the genesis block: no line can be created after the fact without changing chains.",
 "chaine.span.verification": "Verification",
