 "ecosysteme.meta.name-description.coinbosa-card-plateforme-neo": "Coinbosa Card, the neobank platform, CoinBosa Omni AI Studio, CoinBosa Academy and CoinBosa VPN: the five products of the CoinBosa ecosystem, carried by the Coinbosa Chain.",
 "ecosysteme.meta.name-twitter-description.coinbosa-card-plateforme-neo": "Coinbosa Card, the neobank platform, Omni AI Studio, Academy and VPN: the five products of the CoinBosa ecosystem, carried by the Coinbosa Chain.",
 "ecosysteme.meta.name-twitter-title.ecosysteme-cinq-produits-et": "Ecosystem — five products and the chain that carries them",
 "ecosysteme.meta.property-og-description.coinbosa-card-plateforme-neo": "Coinbosa Card, the neobank platform, Omni AI Studio, Academy and VPN: the five products of the CoinBosa ecosystem, carried by the Coinbosa Chain.",
 "ecosysteme.meta.property-og-title.ecosysteme-cinq-produits-et": "Ecosystem — five products and the chain that carries them",
 "ecosysteme.p.coinbosa-deploie-progressivement-une-infra": "CoinBosa is progressively deploying a neobank infrastructure, in\n          strict compliance with local and international financial regulations.",
 "ecosysteme.p.coinbosa-reunit-une-infrastructure-blockch": "CoinBosa brings together a sovereign blockchain infrastructure, an\n        orchestration artificial intelligence, borderless FinTech solutions and\n        academic training. Five products, and the chain that carries them.",
 "ecosysteme.p.deployee-en-production-le-7-aout-2026-la-c": "Deployed to production on August 7, 2026, the Coinbosa Chain is a\n          sovereign EVM blockchain designed for industrial scale and critical\n          financial applications.",
 "ecosysteme.p.deux-services-de-l-ecosysteme-l-un-transme": "Two services of the ecosystem: one transmits, the other protects access.",
 "ecosysteme.p.l-offre-totale-du-coin-bosa-est-fixee-a-70": "The total supply of the BOSA coin is fixed at\n            <span class=\"mono tnum\">700,000,000</span> units. No further issuance\n            will ever take place: the final supply is sealed in the genesis\n            block.",
 "ecosysteme.p.la-chaine-integre-une-suite-defi-et-dex-na": "The chain embeds a native DeFi and DEX suite: developers issue smart\n            contracts on it, create liquidity pools and deploy BRC20 tokens\n            without restriction.",
 "ecosysteme.p.la-plateforme-permet-la-conversion-directe": "The platform allows direct conversion between cryptocurrencies and\n            fiat currency, without going through an intermediary outside the\n            ecosystem.",
 "ecosysteme.p.la-tokenomique-lui-reserve-un-poste-dedie": "The tokenomics sets aside a dedicated allocation for it, the Coinbosa\n            Card financial fund: 10% of the supply, that is\n            <span class=\"mono tnum\">70,000,000</span> BOSA, held as a liquidity\n            reserve for fiat and card transactions.",
 "ecosysteme.p.lancement-du-modele-d-intelligence-artific": "Launch of the proprietary CoinBosa artificial intelligence model,\n            trained on financial and software engineering data.",
 "ecosysteme.p.le-deploiement-se-fait-sous-le-regime-des": "Deployment takes place under local and international financial\n            regulations, KYC and AML included. Compliance is not a step added\n            after the fact: it conditions the opening of each banking service.",
 "ecosysteme.p.le-module-est-un-orchestrateur-d-intellige": "The module is an advanced artificial intelligence orchestrator, which\n          resolves the complexity of model selection: for each request, it\n          computes a suitability score, keeps the optimal model, generates the\n          workflow and distributes the instructions.",
 "ecosysteme.p.le-projet-repond-a-la-fragmentation-entre": "The project addresses the fragmentation between decentralized finance,\n          everyday cryptocurrency use and universal access to artificial\n          intelligence technologies. The native BOSA coin, whose supply is\n          sealed at 700,000,000 units, circulates throughout.",
 "ecosysteme.p.le-socle-en-detailles-parametres-du-reseau": "<strong>The foundation, in detail</strong>The network settings, the native BOSA coin and the breakdown of its supply.",
 "ecosysteme.p.les-depots-et-les-retraits-bancaires-sont": "Bank deposits and withdrawals are automated, which closes the loop\n            between a fiat currency account and the assets held on the chain.",
 "ecosysteme.p.pensee-des-2022-la-coinbosa-card-ouvre-l-a": "Designed as early as 2022, the Coinbosa Card opens direct access to\n          physical payments worldwide.",
 "ecosysteme.p.plateforme-de-formation-ayant-deja-enseign": "Training platform that has already taught several thousand students.\n            It brings together online training and regional seminars, focused on\n            FinTech, blockchain, artificial intelligence and trading. The\n            tokenomics associates it with the Events and training allocation:\n            2% of the supply, that is\n            <span class=\"mono tnum\">14,000,000</span> BOSA.",
 "ecosysteme.p.pour-chaque-modele-disponible-le-moteur-co": "For each available model, the engine combines three weighted terms:\n            the probability that the model fits the domain of the request, the\n            inverse of its latency and its accuracy. The model selected is the\n            one whose score is highest.",
 "ecosysteme.p.recherche-finance-fintech-5-de-l-offre-soi": "Finance &amp; FinTech research: 5% of the supply, that is\n            <span class=\"mono tnum\">35,000,000</span> BOSA, allocated to\n            compliance research and neobank products.",
 "ecosysteme.p.reseau-prive-virtuel-proprietaire-il-garan": "Proprietary virtual private network. It guarantees secure and private\n            access to the CoinBosa servers from any region of the world.",
 "ecosysteme.p.support-multi-modele-universel-generation": "Universal multi-model support: code generation, image creation,\n            content writing, analysis.",
 "ecosysteme.p.un-detenteur-de-cryptomonnaies-se-trouve-d": "A cryptocurrency holder is unable to make everyday purchases, or to\n            obtain cash immediately during international travel. That is the\n            major problem the card takes on.",
 "ecosysteme.p.une-fois-le-modele-choisi-l-orchestrateur": "Once the model is chosen, the orchestrator generates the workflow and\n            distributes the instructions to the specialized agents: Code, Image,\n            Text, Video.",
 "ecosysteme.span.banque": "Banking",
 "ecosysteme.span.ces-services-comptent-parmi-les-cas-d-usag": "<b>These services are among the use cases already in production.</b>\n        On that basis, the whitepaper cites the VPN, the Academy, the chain and\n        Omni AI.",
 "ecosysteme.span.chacun-de-ces-parametres-se-relit-sur-la-c": "<b>Every one of these settings can be read back on the chain.</b>\n        The genesis block hash, the Chain ID and the epoch rollover can be\n        verified from the public endpoint, without taking our word for it.",
 "ecosysteme.span.ecosysteme": "Ecosystem",
 "ecosysteme.span.formation-et-confidentialite": "Training and privacy",
 "ecosysteme.span.intelligence-artificielle": "Artificial intelligence",
 "ecosysteme.span.la-portee-est-mondiale-sans-limitation-reg": "<b>The reach is worldwide, with no regional restriction.</b>\n        Unlike competing cards — such as Trust Wallet — restricted to Europe or\n        the United States, the Coinbosa Card is deployed worldwide.",
 "ecosysteme.span.le-modele-proprietaire-a-son-poste-dans-la": "<b>The proprietary model has its own allocation in the tokenomics.</b>\n        AI research: 10% of the supply, that is 70,000,000 BOSA, devoted to the\n        development of the proprietary CoinBosa artificial intelligence model.",
